Modifications
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is a derivative work of
https://github.com/pollen-robotics/reachy_mini

Changes made in this derivative, per Apache-2.0 section 4(b):

  * Added src/agent_system/ - a cloud conversation pipeline
    (speech-to-text, LLM, tool calls, text-to-speech, robot motion).
  * Added tests/my_tests/ and diagnose_motors.py - manual hardware
    diagnostic scripts run against a physical robot.
  * Added CONTROL_CHAIN.md, EMOTIONS.md and MOTOR_REFERENCE.md -
    reference notes on the control chain and the motor layout.
  * Translated README.md, RELEASE.md and docs/notebooks/ into
    Traditional Chinese.

The per-file record of these changes is the commit history of this
repository.
